    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6947" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">casses</span></b> , ium (in <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>sing. acc.</i> cassem,
					<i><span class="en">Grat. Cyn. 28</span></i>;
			abl. casse, <i><span class="en">Ov. A. A. 3, 554</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Sen. Agam. 885, p. 893</span></i> Bip.),
			m., <i>a hunting-net</i>, <i>a
				snare</i>, <i>toil</i> (<b>poet.</b>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in prose: plaga, retia),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 371</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Tib. 4, 3, 17</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Prop. 4</span></i>
			(5), 2, 33; <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 5, 579
			al.</span></i>—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b>Meton.</b>, <i>a spider</i>'<i>s web</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 4, 247</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 3,
				93, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Arn. 6,
			202</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>, <i>snares</i>, <i>plots</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">casses tendere alicui,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Tib.
					1, 6, 5</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ov. A. A. 3, 554</span></i>.</div>
